      "lineage": {
        "description": "Post-event impact data collected by IOM through DTM standard methodology following heavy monsoon rainfall (12 June - 25 July 2020) that triggered widespread flooding and landslides across multiple districts in Nepal. The dataset documents verified casualty figures (deaths, injuries, missing persons) and displacement counts reported by the National Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Authority and field assessments.",
